| CAUGHT (['CH2'])\nC9 per-scenario block off | G24c | CAUGHT (['G24m', 'G24c', 'G24x', 'G4x'])\nC9 scenario coverage off | G24d | CAUGHT (['G24d'])\nchanged compares midpoints | CH4 | CAUGHT (['CH4'])\nchanged counts sibling sources | CH3 | CAUGHT (['CH1', 'CH3'])\noperand count unchecked | G24c3 | CAUGHT (['G24c3', 'G24a1'])\nsingle-scenario citation allowed | G4c | CAUGHT (['G4c'])\nsigns unchecked | G24s0 | CAUGHT (['G24s1', 'G24s0'])\nC9 sensitivity off | G24x | CAUGHT (['G24x', 'G4x'])\nC9 sensitivity on intervals (46o code) | G4x | CAUGHT (['G4x'])\nnumbers unchecked | G24nv | CAUGHT (['G24nv'])\nrung range unchecked | R1rneg | CAUGHT (['R1rneg', 'R1r6'])\nC6 ignores bounds | R4b2 | CAUGHT (['R4b2', 'R4b3'])\nC3 off | R1a | CAUGHT (['R1a', 'R1qb'])\ncrossings ignore open ends | R4b3 | CAUGHT (['R4b3'])\nC1 accepts any substring (alone) | T9 | CAUGHT (['T9'])\nC5 allows estimates | P3b | CAUGHT (['P3b'])\nper-unit identity ignores scope | P4 | CAUGHT (['P4'])\nper-unit inverse loses its scale | G3inv | CAUGHT (['G3inv'])\nC2 tolerance 50% | P2 | CAUGHT (['P2', 'U2'])\nbound direction ignored | R4m | CAUGHT (['R4m'])\nC9 same base off (both clauses) | G4m | CAUGHT (['G24m', 'G24d', 'G24c', 'G24x', 'G4x', 'G4c', 'G4m'])\nC10 prior not authenticated | P3c | CAUGHT (['P3c'])\nNot a mutant: C3's open-low-end clause in _exceeds. A representable figure with an open low end is a '>' or 'approx_above' bound, whose high end is unbounded, so the high-end clause already refuses it (R1qb). The clause stays as a guard and cannot be exercised alone.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
